  "inSpec": true,
  "text": "Study Figure 1 in the Resource Booklet.\nThis is part of an investigation into the spatial impacts of tsunami events.\n(i) Calculate the mean number of deaths recorded.\nMean = .............................................................................................\n(ii) Calculate the median number of deaths recorded.\nMedian = .............................................................................................\n(iii) Calculate the interquartile range for the number of deaths recorded.\nYou must show your working.\nInterquartile range = .............................................................................................",
  "ms": "Mark\nnumber\nAO3 (4 marks)\n(i) Award 1 mark the calculation of the mean number of deaths recorded of (1)\n98.8. Accept 99 but reject 98.\nNote: If the candidate has written the correct answer of 98.8 in their\nworkings but rounded up incorrectly in the answer space\n‘Mean………………..’, then accept the correct working result.\n(ii) Award 1 mark for the calculation of the median number of deaths (1)\nrecorded of 11. Accept correct working.\n(iii) Award 1 mark for the two quartiles (3 and 156). (2)\nAward 1 mark for the accurate calculation of the interquartile range of\n153.\nAllow 1 mark for the correct use of the mathematical formula for\ninterquartile range but if rounding is incorrect they are limited to 1 mark.",
  "pageFrom": 2,
  "pageTo": 2,
  "pdf": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 1 (Physical)/Questions/June 2019 QP.pdf",
  "rb": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 1 (Physical)/Resource Booklet/June 2019 RB.pdf",
  "rbFrom": null,
