  "ms": "Indicative content Mark\nnumber (1)\nAO3 (4 marks) (1)\n(2)\n(i) 1 mark for mean of 7.4 (mean is 7.37 so to one decimal place 7.4)\n1 mark for the median 103\n(ii)\n(iii)\n1 mark for the working of 1115 – 23\n1 mark for the interquartile range of 1092",
