  "marks": 10,
  "topic": "geo-t8a",
  "topicConfident": true,
  "inSpec": true,
  "text": "Study Figure 3 below.\nCountry Life expectancy at Healthcare spending\nUnited States birth (years) per capita (US$)\n77.0 12,318\nSwitzerland 84.0 7,179\nNorway 83.2 6,536\nLuxembourg 82.8 5,596\nTurkey 78.6 1,305\nUnited Kingdom 80.4 5,019\nSingapore 89.2 2,632\nJapan 84.7 4,666\nFigure 3\nLife expectancy at birth and healthcare spending (2020) for selected developed countries\n(i) Calculate the mean life expectancy at birth for the countries shown\nin Figure 3.\nGive your answer to one decimal place.\nYou must show your working.\n.............................................................. years\n\n(ii) Calculate the range in healthcare spending for the countries shown.\nYou must show your working.\nUS$ ..............................................................\n(iii) Study Figure 3.\nSuggest why life expectancy varies for these developed countries.\n Turn over",
