  "text": "Using the data in Figure 3 PMT\n(i) Calculate the value of d2 for United States.\n(ii) Calculate ¦ d 2. ...............................\n(iii) Calculate the value of rs using the formula below.\n6¦ d 2 ...............................\nrs 1\u0010 2\nn\u000bn \u00101\nYou must show your working.\nGive your answer to two decimal places.\nrs = ...............................\n Turn over\nThe rs value is statistically significant at the 95% level, therefore the null hypothesis\ncan be rejected, and the alternative hypothesis can be accepted.\nThe alternative hypothesis: there is a statistically significant relationship between\nhealth expenditure per capita and life expectancy.\n(iv) Suggest reasons for the relationship between health expenditure per capita\nand life expectancy.\n",
